      "mergedPostDetails": "I found a bug in Desktop Mode where the cursor used to interact with the Go button does not appear.\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\nEnable the Go button.\n\nEnter a world in Desktop Mode.\n\nAttempt to press the Go button.\n\nExpected Behavior:\n\nThe interaction cursor should be visible and allow the user to see where they are pointing.\n\nActual Behavior:\n\nThe interaction cursor is invisible. However, the Go button still highlights when pointed at, indicating that the cursor position is being detected.\n\nFrequency:\n\nOccurs every time when entering the first world after launching VRChat. The issue does not occur when changing worlds or re-entering a world without restarting VRChat.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1856] Cursor does not appear when using the Go button in Desktop Mode",
